<section class="listing-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Real places, clear credits</span><h1>The photographs<br>behind the guide.</h1><p class="lead">Licensed and public-domain photographs of identifiable Antalya locations. Every image keeps its author, source and reuse information.</p><p>Destination images do not depict a hotel’s rooms, facilities or the event on the page. Property-specific photographs are archival and dated. They do not confirm current condition or branding.</p><p>Images are sourced from Wikimedia Commons, Flickr and Pexels. Each credit identifies the image source and any resizing or conversion. Selected hotel galleries preserve the full frame, including photographer watermarks; destination images may be responsively cropped for display. The indicated image licences continue to apply to these image derivatives. Website text and code are not covered by an image’s licence.</p></div></section>
<section><div class="container"><div class="editorial-photo-grid">{% for photo in editorialPhotos %}<figure class="editorial-photo"><img{% if photo.preserve_framing %} data-preserve-framing="true"{% endif %} src="{{ photo.src }}" alt="{{ photo.alt }}" width="{{ photo.width }}" height="{{ photo.height }}" loading="lazy"><figcaption>{{ photo.caption }}{% if photo.archive_warning %}<p>{{ photo.archive_warning }}</p>{% elif photo.usage_note %}<p>{{ photo.usage_note }}</p>{% endif %}<span class="photo-credit">{{ photo.author }} · {% if photo.license_url %}<a href="{{ photo.license_url }}">{{ photo.license }}</a>{% else %}{{ photo.license }}{% endif %} · <a href="{{ photo.source_url }}">Original source and licence evidence</a>{% if photo.changes %} · {{ photo.changes }}{% endif %}</span></figcaption></figure>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
